<html>
<body>
<p>Bitte tragen sie gewuenschten Rechnen Operationen ein.</p>
<form action = "ArimetischeOperatoren1.php" method = "post">

<p><input name ="w1" /> Wert 1<p>
<p><input name ="w2" /> Wert 2<p>
<p><input type ="radio" name="oper" value="+" checked="checked" /> Addition</p>
<p><input type ="radio" name="oper" value="-"/> Subtraktion</p>
<p><input type ="radio" name="oper" value="*"/> Multiplaktion</p>
<p><input type ="radio" name="oper" value="/"/> Division</p>
<p><input type ="submit" />
<input type ="reset" /></p>


</form>
</body>
</html>